      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "313a0d96-712b-4b75-97cd-cda5a490af19"],
     ", admissible pairs and DAG branches in random order \[LongDash] put ",
     Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "207cc9b0-5565-4b61-8864-8ce5e752cf9a"],
     " in front of a call whose output goes into a figure. The class is the \
same under every value."
